payload.description:
After target deployment is verified and only after a separate DNS approval, add ACM validation records in the existing anth.us hosted zone and change only the A and AAAA aliases for cyclotron.anth.us to the target distribution.

Tests and evidence:
- public certificate validates for cyclotron.anth.us;
- target distribution returns the expected Learn guide;
- main revision source, build, and deploy are recorded;
- DNS resolves to the new distribution;
- rollback is the previous legacy alias target, preserved until the post-cutover observation window ends.

Do not move the whole zone or delete legacy resources.
